# INTENTIONAL OMISSION: the CFF specification normally requires a `version`
# field for software entries. Project rules forbid assigning any version
# numbers anywhere in this repository, so `version` (and the related
# `date-released`) is deliberately omitted here. The canonical citation
# identity of a checkout is its Git commit hash, not a release tag.
